# What graphify must not read in this repo.
#
# Images: 842 of them, and CLAUDE.md says never to open one — they are
# Zeroheight assets matched by filename and hash only, never by content.
# Reading them was 92% of the corpus and the bulk of the token cost.
**/images/
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.svg

# History. The retired plan, briefs and handoff note were moved here so
# nobody works from them. A graph that reads them hands a future session
# the old way of working as if it were current.
project/archive/

